# Ravenous Amulet's first ability is "Activate only as a sorcery": only in its controller's main phase with an empty stack.
# Bot1 casts Moxen, Memnite and the Amulet on turn 1 and keeps Pearl's mana untapped. On Bot2's turn 2 (an empty stack, an
# untapped Amulet, a creature to sacrifice, mana) the ability is refused. On Bot1's turn 3 the same ability works in the first
# main phase (the positive control), drawing a card (Bot1 draws Lightning Bolt for the turn and an Island from the Amulet).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Ravenous Amulet
Memnite
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ravenous Amulet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Upkeep]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Ravenous Amulet.Activate(Ability: Draw a card)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Ravenous Amulet.Activate(Ability: Draw a card)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite
Bot1.Battlefield.Ravenous Amulet.Counters.Soul = 1
